{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":18,"code":"JOB","name":"Job","testament":"OT"},"chapter":17,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"JOB 17:1"},"My breath is corrupt, my days are extinct, the graves ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are ready "]},"for me. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"JOB 17:2"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Are there"]}," not mockers with me? and doth not mine eye continue in their provocation? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"JOB 17:3"},"Lay down now, put me in a surety with thee; who ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," he ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," will strike hands with me? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"JOB 17:4"},"For thou hast hid their heart from understanding: therefore shalt thou not exalt ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["them. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"JOB 17:5"},"He that speaketh flattery to ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," friends, even the eyes of his children shall fail. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"JOB 17:6"},"He hath made me also a byword of the people; and aforetime I was as a tabret. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"JOB 17:7"},"Mine eye also is dim by reason of sorrow, and all my members ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are "]},"as a shadow. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"JOB 17:8"},"Upright ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," shall be astonied at this, and the innocent shall stir up himself against the hypocrite. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"JOB 17:9"},"The righteous also shall hold on his way, and he that hath clean hands shall be stronger and stronger. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"JOB 17:10"},"But as for you all, do ye return, and come now: for I cannot find ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["one"]}," wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," among you. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"JOB 17:11"},"My days are past, my purposes are broken off, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["even"]}," the thoughts of my heart. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"JOB 17:12"},"They change the night into day: the light ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," short because of darkness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"JOB 17:13"},"If I wait, the grave ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," mine house: I have made my bed in the darkness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"JOB 17:14"},"I have said to corruption, Thou ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["art"]}," my father: to the worm, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["Thou art"]}," my mother, and my sister. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"JOB 17:15"},"And where ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," now my hope? as for my hope, who shall see it? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"JOB 17:16"},"They shall go down to the bars of the pit, when ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["our"]}," rest together ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," in the dust. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"JOB 17:16"}]}]}
